TRADING RISK DISCLAIMER

This software can place live orders on a real trading account when
TRADING_BOT_ALLOW_LIVE=true and the bot is put into live mode. Trading leveraged
instruments carries a substantial risk of loss. You are solely responsible for
any orders placed by this software, for configuring the risk limits in
lib/risk-limits.js, and for verifying every signal before acting on it. Nothing
in this repository is financial advice.
